    "body": "I implemented this, including the testing before I saw your PR.\r\n\r\nI have a small improvement suggestion: since TF state depends on the terraform version, it might be interesting to show the currently installed terraform version with this module.\r\nWe could show the workspace by adding it to the package module.\r\nAlternatively we could make the terraform module show both:\r\n```\r\nvia 💠 0.12.13 in dev\r\n```",
